@startuml
' OWNER-MVP-2026-11-04 review: MVP core / cross-cutting. Core presentation/application/files or shared authority/recovery invariant remains applicable.
title Proposed selected source update and separate publication
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial

actor Owner
participant "Presentation handler" as H
database "Owned revision state" as DB
participant "Files reference contract" as F
Owner -> H : compare exact source / draft versions
H -> DB : read authorized consistent pair
DB --> H : versions + content
H --> Owner : differences (no mutation)
Owner -> H : apply selected differences / expected versions
H -> DB : authority + version guard; commit draft / result
DB --> H : new draft version or conflict
H --> Owner : saved draft; publication unchanged
== Separate explicit owner confirmation ==
Owner -> H : publish reviewed draft / expected live version
H -> F : protect exact usable evidence references
F --> H : protection identity or unavailable
alt current authority, versions and prerequisites valid
 H -> DB : commit immutable manifest + pointer + result
 DB --> H : actual publication identity
 H -> F : finalize using committed publication evidence
 H --> Owner : published content identity; rendition status separate
else denied / conflict / unavailable
 H --> Owner : no new publication; reconcile reference protection
end
note over H,F
 Lost acknowledgments require reconciliation of the same operation.
 Protection remains until consumer outcome permits safe release.
 Concrete transaction and race synchronization remain to be specified.
end note
@enduml
